    line: "As salsa traveled across Latin America, Cali developed a musical and dance culture of its own. Influenced by Caribbean records and Colombian traditions, salsa caleña became famous for its lightning-fast footwork. The city’s clubs, dance schools and performers helped make Cali a world capital of salsa.",
